Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.88,0:22:29.30,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Just my imagination
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.43,0:22:39.02,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx70}samekaketa koucha nominagara  yubi ni karamu ito o asobase
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.77,0:22:48.07,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,bossa nova no rhythm de keikai ni arukou
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:53.04,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,puzzle no piece wa te no naka sa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:59.37,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,sou sa  Ah-Ah-Ah-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:09.22,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}raishuu mo ore wa chigau fuku de onaji basho ni iru sa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:16.64,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Step by Step  aseru-koto nante nai no sa
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:23.06,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Case by Case  warawareta-tte kamawanai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:32.78,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}kazoekirenu hibi no mukou ni  aitsu ga matte-iru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.20,0:23:37.33,RMLyrics2,,0,0,0,,I gotta go my own way
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.43,0:22:39.02,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx80}Playing with threads around my finger while drinking lukewarm tea
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.77,0:22:48.07,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Let's walk lightly to the bossa nova rhythm
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.16,0:22:53.04,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,The puzzle pieces are in my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.25,0:22:59.37,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.50,0:23:09.22,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,I'll be in the same place next week but with different clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.55,0:23:16.64,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Step by step, there's no reason to be anxious
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.56,0:23:23.06,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Case by case, I don't care if you laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.44,0:23:32.78,TLLyrics2,,0,0,0,,Beyond the countless days, she's waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.31,0:00:02.81,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur2}اسمي كودو شينتشي
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.81,0:00:06.55,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,انا محقق شهير قام بحل عدد لايحصى من القضايا
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:08.99,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur2}لقد حللت الجريمة التي وقعت على متن الافعوانية بكل سهولة
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:11.99,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur2}لكن بعدها ارغمت على تناول عقار سام من منظمة سرية
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.99,0:00:12.99,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur2}والوضع سيئ جدا
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:15.12,Narration,Comment,0,0,0,,{\blur2}ران!مالذي سيحدث لي
